---
import Figure from './Figure.astro';
---

<Figure caption="Visitors reach the apps only through the tunnel, which cloudflared opens from the inside. Admins reach SSH over the tailnet. The proxy listens on 127.0.0.1, so the server's public address answers nothing. The dashed path is the origin bypass this setup exists to close.">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 720 320" role="img" aria-labelledby="ing-t ing-d">
    <title id="ing-t">A server reachable only through a tunnel and a tailnet</title>
    <desc id="ing-d">Visitors connect to the Cloudflare edge. cloudflared on the server keeps outbound connections open to the edge and forwards requests to Traefik on 127.0.0.1, which routes to the apps. An admin laptop connects over Tailscale to SSH on the tailnet address. A direct connection from the internet to the public address on port 443 is shown crossed out.</desc>
    <defs>
      <marker id="ing-a" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M0 0L10 5L0 10z" class="d-fill-mint"></path></marker>
      <marker id="ing-af" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M0 0L10 5L0 10z" class="d-fill-fail"></path></marker>
    </defs>
    <rect x="10" y="40" width="120" height="50" rx="4" class="d-box"></rect>
    <text x="70" y="62" text-anchor="middle" class="d-label">Visitors</text>
    <text x="70" y="78" text-anchor="middle" class="d-small">app.example.com</text>
    <path d="M130 65H182" class="d-line-mint" marker-end="url(#ing-a)"></path>
    <rect x="185" y="40" width="140" height="50" rx="4" class="d-box-strong"></rect>
    <text x="255" y="62" text-anchor="middle" class="d-label">Cloudflare edge</text>
    <text x="255" y="78" text-anchor="middle" class="d-small">WAF, Access, limits</text>
    <rect x="360" y="20" width="350" height="280" rx="6" class="d-box"></rect>
    <text x="376" y="42" class="d-label">Your server</text>
    <text x="376" y="58" class="d-small">public address 198.51.100.20 answers nothing</text>
    <path d="M325 65C360 65 365 105 402 105" class="d-line-mint" marker-start="url(#ing-a)"></path>
    <text x="300" y="125" class="d-small">outbound only</text>
    <rect x="405" y="80" width="120" height="48" rx="4" class="d-box-mint"></rect>
    <text x="465" y="102" text-anchor="middle" class="d-label">cloudflared</text>
    <text x="465" y="118" text-anchor="middle" class="d-small">opens the tunnel</text>
    <path d="M525 104H560" class="d-line-mint" marker-end="url(#ing-a)"></path>
    <rect x="563" y="80" width="130" height="48" rx="4" class="d-box-mint"></rect>
    <text x="628" y="102" text-anchor="middle" class="d-label">Traefik</text>
    <text x="628" y="118" text-anchor="middle" class="d-code">127.0.0.1:443</text>
    <path d="M628 128V158" class="d-line-mint" marker-end="url(#ing-a)"></path>
    <rect x="563" y="161" width="130" height="40" rx="4" class="d-box"></rect>
    <text x="628" y="186" text-anchor="middle" class="d-label">Apps, no ports</text>
    <rect x="10" y="230" width="120" height="50" rx="4" class="d-box"></rect>
    <text x="70" y="252" text-anchor="middle" class="d-label">Admin laptop</text>
    <text x="70" y="268" text-anchor="middle" class="d-small">on the tailnet</text>
    <path d="M130 255H402" class="d-line-mint" marker-end="url(#ing-a)"></path>
    <text x="190" y="246" class="d-small">Tailscale, WireGuard</text>
    <rect x="405" y="231" width="150" height="48" rx="4" class="d-box-mint"></rect>
    <text x="480" y="253" text-anchor="middle" class="d-label">sshd</text>
    <text x="480" y="269" text-anchor="middle" class="d-code">100.64.0.10:22</text>
    <path d="M70 90C70 170 250 175 400 175" class="d-line-fail"></path>
    <path d="M384 166L400 184M400 166L384 184" class="d-line-fail" style="stroke-dasharray:none"></path>
    <text x="150" y="196" class="d-text-fail">direct to the origin :443, closed</text>
  </svg>
</Figure>
